// Starter example. Two boxes and one line show the shape of the notation
時系列図 Ask to sign in

browser = User's browser「operated by the user」 [色 slate] [印 globe]
app = App「asks for sign-in」 [色 blue] [印 app]

# Press sign in
> The user presses the app's sign-in button. The app leaves identity checks to the authorization server.
browser -> app : GET /login
